      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":833.0,"y":269.0},"guid":"d6acf602-e108-42dd-b5ee-0d2388fa72eb","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"28"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":1,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":250.0,"y":452.0},"guid":"8bbe03b5-197a-4254-a458-c8f17d9f33a2","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"3367"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":209.0,"y":-367.0},"guid":"98b461c8-9612-46c1-8d48-f0166027dc72","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"3369"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":0,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":584.0,"y":-1126.0},"guid":"cc331760-b0d8-4ea5-8b1a-62d77ee977bb","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"3371"},{"portType":"System.Object","SnapToGrid":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":2999.0,"y":1059.0},"guid":"b6bb640e-1f90-443b-bd79-8080e21a4c85","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Community.ValueReroute","$id":"3373"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":4078.0,"y":734.0},"guid":"477be425-645e-4593-b319-e5bfb58a1e70","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"3375"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"strongestRemainingCardByColor","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":4468.0,"y":698.0},"guid":"b187758c-322e-4c58-a4be-2161de7c3872","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"3377"},{"dictionary":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":2822.0,"y":708.0},"guid":"1e27ca21-7679-49d9-a3a0-b4f9ac83fb46","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ForEach","$id":"3379"},{"ignoreCase":false,"options":["PlayerHuman","P